WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Time Machine starts at the beginning of a saved match. The set tiles show dashes before play.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
The replay moves through recorded points. Score, set tiles and game momentum change together.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Deuce and Advantage appear as the replay advances, with score-flip sound.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Scrubbing moves the match timeline and its match-flow line to another point.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The same replay continues in landscape, with the score and momentum visible side by side.
